/-- Blueprint `eq:side-windows` (lines 2549-2560) for the reference terms of a three-core test,
with only `ℓ²` norms: with Haar coefficients `a_n = ⟨D_{m₀}, χ_n⟩` at `1`-separated reference
frequencies `r α_n`, `|Σ_n a_n P(α_n, β₀)|` is at most
