      (((ModeComponents.upperHeights D.SP.Jst D.SP.δs).card : ℝ) ^ n)⁻¹ *
        D.coreSize G I xs (h - D.SP.Δ) j (D.maskSel G I j asg w h (D.finCls G I j h m))
          (ns w) ^ 2 ≤
